    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i started taking these new biotin and chromium pills for my diabetes like 2 days ago and i feel kinda weird. im like insanely thirsty and i cant stop peeing every 30 mins or so. i also feel really wiped out and kinda foggy headed. u think this is just the supplements kicking in or should i be worried?",
